VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_LtSurgeIntro::
	.string "SURGE: Hey, little boy!\p"
	.string "I have to hand it to you. It may not\n"
	.string "be very smart to challenge me, but\l"
	.string "it takes guts!\p"
	.string "When it comes to electric POKéMON,\n"
	.string "I’m number one!\p"
	.string "I’ve never lost on the battlefield.\p"
	.string "I’ll zap you just like I did my\n"
	.string "enemies in war!$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_LtSurgeDefeat::
	.string "SURGE: Arrrgh!\n"
	.string "You are strong!\p"
	.string "OK, boy. You get THUNDERBADGE!\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the THUNDERBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_LtSurge_1::
	.string "SURGE: Hey, boy!\n"
	.string "Still slugging and chugging away?\p"
	.string "My POKéMON and I are still at it!$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_LtSurge_2::
	.string "SURGE: THUNDERBADGE increases\n"
	.string "POKéMON’s speed.\p"
	.string "Consider it proof that you defeated\n"
	.string "me. You wear it proudly, hear?$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_LtSurge_3::
	.string "SURGE: OH, boy! I seem to forget...\p"
	.string "There was this weird kid that came\n"
	.string "here and defeated me before...\p"
	.string "He said you would show up here,\n"
	.string "so he left a message for you\p"
	.string "”Keep training and we’ll battle again\n"
	.string "soon.” That’s what he said.$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_JugglerHortonIntro::
	.string "I’m going to take you down! Prepare\n"
	.string "to be shocked!$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_JugglerHortonDefeat::
	.string "Gwaaah!\n"
	.string "I was overpowered...$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_JugglerHorton::
	.string "Don’t get too comfortable about\n"
	.string "beating me...\l"
	.string "LT.SURGE is tough.$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GuitaristVincentIntro::
	.string "LT.SURGE recognized my potential\n"
	.string "with electric POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Think you can beat me?$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GuitaristVincentDefeat::
	.string "Ooh, how shocking!$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GuitaristVincent::
	.string "If the GYM’s traps were working, you\n"
	.string "would have been toast...$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo! CHAMP in making!\p"
	.string "You lucked out this time.\p"
	.string "LT.SURGE is very cautious. He has\n"
	.string "traps set all over the GYM.\p"
	.string "But--he-heh--the traps aren’t\n"
	.string "active right now.\p"
	.string "You’ll have no problem getting to\n"
	.string "LT.SURGE.$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "Whew! That was an electrifying bout!\n"
	.string "It sure made me nervous.$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GentlemanGregoryIntro::
	.string "You’re here to defeat LT.SURGE?\p"
	.string "Not if I can help it!$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GentlemanGregoryDefeat::
	.string "Sorry if I failed you, LT.SURGE,\n"
	.string "sir!$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_GentlemanGregory::
	.string "When I was still in the army, LT.\n"
	.string "SURGE saved my life.$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "VERMILLION CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: LT.SURGE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "VERMILLION CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: LT.SURGE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS {PLAYER}$"

VermilionCity_Interior16_Text_Sign3::
	.string "Nope! Nothing here.$"
